    "enUS": {
      "description": "Rimtori's tome still sits atop its pedestal. Who knows what secrets its pages could hold? \r\n\r\nPerhaps it would be best not to leave such a powerful artifact out here in the wilds.",
      "dialogue": {
        "3d1056c45274f2379cfd": "Well now, perhaps Belgrom's petty quest for riches and revenge hasn't all been for naught...",
        "ef6be236ee189b4f3989": "What do you have there, $c?"
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning back to Jediga in Valormok.",
